Karen.

309
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:03,420
Good evening.

310
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:05,140
My name is Karen Roush

311
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:06,540
and I would like to share with you

312
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,500
a clinical case

313
00:16:07,500 --> 00:16:09,620
from our regional cardiology department

314
00:16:09,620 --> 00:16:10,900
in Toowoomba, Australia,

315
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,760
who underwent further management

316
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:14,480
with Professor Harris Harkani

317
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:16,200
at the Prince Charles Hospital.

318
00:16:17,420 --> 00:16:17,800
So,

319
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:19,380
this was a 25-year-old mother

320
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:20,680
of three young children

321
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:22,540
who presented after an assault

322
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:24,040
with an orbital fracture.

323
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:26,540
She had no significant past medical

324
00:16:26,540 --> 00:16:27,640
or family history

325
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:29,840
and no use of illicit substances.

326
00:16:30,700 --> 00:16:32,000
In the emergency department,

327
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,160
she was noted to have

328
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,040
asymptomatic bradycardia

329
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:37,500
with a markedly abnormal ECG.

330
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:38,900
As you can see,

331
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:40,280
she had two is to one

332
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:42,180
second degree AV block,

333
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,000
diffuse T-wave aversion

334
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,600
and prolonged QT.

335
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:47,940
She had a significant

336
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:49,760
troponin rise to 1150

337
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:51,600
but normal electrolytes.

338
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:55,020
Her echocardiography revealed

339
00:16:55,020 --> 00:16:56,660
great vessels in parallel,

340
00:16:57,220 --> 00:16:59,120
an aorta situated anteriorly,

341
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:01,260
and a morphologic right ventricle

342
00:17:01,260 --> 00:17:02,640
connecting to the aorta,

343
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,800
consistent with a new diagnosis

344
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,380
of congenitally corrected

345
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:08,380
transposition of the great arteries

346
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:10,120
with mild to moderate

347
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:11,280
global systemic

348
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:12,640
right ventricular dysfunction.

349
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:15,520
A CT coronary angiogram

350
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:17,520
showed no coronary artery disease

351
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:18,940
and a cardiac MRI

352
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:21,160
showed no fibrosis,

353
00:17:21,320 --> 00:17:22,540
edema or infarction.

354
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:24,440
And it was therefore likely

355
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:26,420
that her ECG change

356
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:27,420
and troponin rise

357
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:28,260
was due to

358
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:30,000
a Takotsubo cardiomyopathy.

359
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:33,340
On exercise testing,

360
00:17:33,540 --> 00:17:34,040
she developed

361
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:35,340
significant fatigue

362
00:17:35,340 --> 00:17:36,000
and dyspnea

363
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,000
and marked

364
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,340
chronotropic incompetence

365
00:17:38,340 --> 00:17:39,160
and therefore

366
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,480
a dual-chamber pacemaker

367
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,320
was inserted.

368
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:42,640
And this is her

369
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,660
paced ECG

370
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:44,700
sometime later.

371
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,900
So our question to you is,

372
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,500
which structure

373
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:50,680
is being captured

374
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,240
by the ventricular lead

375
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:52,680
pacing

376
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,420
on this ECG?

377
00:17:55,580 --> 00:17:56,880
OK, the voting

378
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:57,920
is now open.

379
00:17:58,060 --> 00:17:58,660
Please vote.

380
00:17:58,660 --> 00:18:00,780
So your options,

381
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:01,500
