382
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:02,640
right bundle branch block,

383
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,320
B, left bundle branch,

384
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:05,120
sorry, not block,

385
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,880
C, left anterior fascicle,

386
00:18:07,260 --> 00:18:08,180
D, his bundle,

387
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:10,260
or E, mid-RV septum.

388
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,440
Rather you guys

389
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,240
than me on this one.

390
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:13,760
So this indeed

391
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:14,740
is an interesting one,

392
00:18:14,820 --> 00:18:15,040
Holly,

393
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,380
in which we have a patient

394
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:17,440
