395
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,100
in which the right ventricle

396
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:20,380
is a systemic ventricle,

397
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,240
which means

398
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,300
all the plumbing

399
00:18:22,300 --> 00:18:23,700
that comes out of the heart

400
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:25,160
