00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:31,680
Oh, thank you.

406
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:33,000
Looking at the ECG,

407
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,540
it's pretty narrow,

408
00:18:34,820 --> 00:18:36,060
