425
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:07,860
Okay,

426
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:09,520
so we could see

427
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:10,220
that on the ECG

428
00:19:10,220 --> 00:19:11,200
the V1 was positive,

429
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:11,980
which makes you think

430
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:12,680
about right bundle.

431
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:14,560
Spontaneous AV block

432
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:15,780
is common in these patients

433
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:16,900
around 2% a year.

434
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:18,720
Long-term apical pacing

435
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:19,840
increases the risk

436
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:20,900
of systemic ventricular

437
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:21,300
dysfunction,

438
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:22,100
as we all know.

439
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:23,680
The conduction system pacing

440
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,080
is therefore an ideal strategy

441
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:25,720
to consider

442
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,580
in these patients.

443
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:27,900
There are anatomical

444
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:28,420
challenges,

445
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:29,020
obviously.

446
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:30,180
The bundle branches

447
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:30,980
are inverted,

448
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:32,400
and the HIST bundle

449
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,160
courses within

450
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,340
the LV-OT septum.

451
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:35,660
So the question

452
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,380
I sort of had

453
00:19:36,380 --> 00:19:36,940
