454
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:38,380
pacing the left

455
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:39,280
ventricular apex

456
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:40,600
causes LV dysfunction,

457
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:41,500
and there is evidence

458
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:42,460
to support that.

459
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:44,160
So because the ventricles

460
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,140
are reversed.

461
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:46,200
Okay,

462
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,980
so essentially

463
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:49,600
your right and left

464
00:19:49,600 --> 00:19:50,620
