465
00:19:50,620 --> 00:19:52,300
one way with the other.

466
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,800
So if you pace

467
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:56,620
the anatomically

468
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:57,720
left-sided,

469
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:59,520
you'll get a right

470
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:00,560
bundle branch block

471
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:01,200
morphology.

472
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:03,140
So you can target

473
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,480
the left bundle branch block

474
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,360
and the subpulmonic

475
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:06,080
left ventricle

476
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,760
or the right bundle branch block

477
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,040
aiming to re-synchronize

478
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:09,960
