482
00:20:12,860 --> 00:20:14,080
which is why

483
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:15,360
this looks like

484
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:17,360
an RBBB morphology.

485
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:18,120
Yes.

486
00:20:18,660 --> 00:20:18,920
Okay?

487
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,620
That's why I do PCI.

